# Scoped to the headless-cam build (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# first). Keep the platform/ context lean: node_modules and dist are rebuilt
# inside the image (npm ci + npm run build); pixi env + lockfiles are unused.
web/node_modules
web/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.pixi
pixi.lock
**/*.pyc
